\n表情：\n目を見開き、口を開けて、目の前の操作系を必死にいじりながら、非常に困惑した表情をしているはずです。\n\nおまけのメモ：\n>耳の先が黒くなっている\n>他の乗組員を描きたくない場合は描く必要はありませんが、描きたい場合は背景に描くことができます。(または、お好きな場所に)\n\n長々としたお願いで申し訳ありません。ご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします！( ^ω^)\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/M8CjRVX", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 100665, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "蒔島梓@バ美肉お絵描きVTuber", "screen_name": "azusa_maxima", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1314754178997055489/h4wkvmY3.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/110404771/1664767245/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": 29, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 177}, {"id": 299608, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "暇人pega", "screen_name": "Lv729798641", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1618251192207048704/AWAwvMiZ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1046693650262941696/1674656125/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 564154, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "エイリゾ/EIRIZO", "screen_name": "EIRRI", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2062283232402673664/rSxMV2DN.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/756845736/1775365961/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank"